null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCIYBKAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCIcBKAE"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3 到 4 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCIgBKAI"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3IcHCIUBKBc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10 到 30 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCIoBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3IcHCIkBKBg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_SOMEWHAT_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車位有點難找",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCIwBKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3IcHCIsBKBk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_LOT"],"付費停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCI4BKAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3IcHCI0BKBo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3YcHCJABKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiKiozQwtKWAxV5e_UHHSGhIDMQ3IcHCI8BKBs",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["鄰近捷運士林站2號出口，主打昭和復古風、濃郁豚骨湯頭。每人低消是一碗拉麵，可以有2次免費加麵，也提供不限次數無調味的豚骨清湯。使用手畫菜單，是少數不用自動點餐機的拉麵店，畫好現金結帳。\n主要的湯頭就是濃厚豚骨湯頭，再區分為醬油或是塩味，其他比較特別的是經典味噌、和歌山濃口醬油湯頭、淡麗正油湯頭\n每碗拉麵都有包含半顆溏心蛋、叉燒肉和海苔，其他調味有紅薑絲、洋蔥、青蔥和木耳，想去掉調味配料，可於點單結帳時提出。其他單點的還有炸物、小點以及飲料啤酒。\n若初次到訪用餐，店員會說明用餐須知，或入座後先看看牆上的消費/用餐須知。\n\n爆香蝦油豚骨：豚骨湯頭上覆蓋著蝦油，撒上炸過的櫻花蝦，即便在餐後喝下滿杯的冰開水，口鼻仍會沉浸在濃濃的蝦香味，推薦。\n醬油の濃厚豚骨：湯頭香濃而不腥羶。\n塩味の濃厚豚骨：湯頭濃郁而略鹹。\n\n主角的叉燒片，對比北投店來說，厚度較薄，略為可惜。麵可選擇硬度，其他配料與湯頭有達到水準與好吃。\n\n士林店是創始店，後來在捷運北投站開第二家店，聽說老闆比較常在北投店，偶有開發品項\"老大限定 special\"，會手寫標示牆上。另於2025年10月新開信義店，有信義店限定的”日式煎餃”品項。",null,[0,147]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDV2xGcmRFdGhSMFoyVFROc1IxbHJaSFZqUlZWM1VsUktOV0pIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDV2xGcmRFdGhSMFoyVFROc1IxbHJaSFZqUlZWM1VsUktOV0pIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDV2xGcmRFdGhSMFoyVFROc1IxbHJaSFZqUlZWM1VsUktOV0pIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDV2xGcmRFdGhSMFoyVFROc1IxbHJaSFZqUlZWM1VsUktOV0pIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDV2xGcmRFdGhSMFoyVFROc1IxbHJaSFZqUlZWM1VsUktOV0pIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDV2xGcmRFdGhSMFoyVFROc1IxbHJaSFZqUlZWM1VsUktOV0pIWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,6507,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWlFrdEthR0Z2TTNsR1lrZHVjRVV3UlRKNWJHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1fe18f27b1b59fb4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjBZQktKaGFvM3lGYkducEUwRTJ5bGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWlFrdEthR0Z2TTNsR1lrZHVjRVV3UlRKNWJHYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWlFrdEthR0Z2TTNsR1lrZHVjRVV3UlRKNWJHYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWlFrdEthR0Z2TTNsR1lrZHVjRVV3UlRKNWJHYxILMGRyVWx2bkhBd2waPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qQlpRa3RLYUdGdk0zbEdZa2R1Y0VVd1JUSjViR2MSCzBkclVsdm5IQXdsIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARtJ-1sSeP4R8qCzBkclVsdm5IQXds\u0026wv\