亭 HASUMENTEI 士林店👈\n\n講到士林的拉麵除了一慣性的連鎖\n模式外，也可以參考像👉荷麵亭👈\n這樣比較傳統性質感覺的店家。\n雖然它也是有其它分店，不過不像\n是新潮流拉麵派系，店家的公告提\n醒也是有寫，如圖。。。\n\n💫 醬油の濃厚豚骨 💫 🍜\n💫 塩味の濃厚豚骨 💫 🍜\n💫 廣島炸牡蠣 💫 2入/80\n💫 日式牛肉漢堡排 💫 /80\n\n以店家來說我只吃過這家，也慶幸\n這次在士林選擇回味此店家，沒去\n隔壁的拉麵店。。。\n⭕️店家滿滿的昭和風味⭕️\n連拉麵都是樸實無華的呈現，吃\n多了很多特殊型態與手法的拉麵，\n反而返真豚骨風味🐷感覺更耐吃\n一點。不過叉燒不是傳統滷製叉\n燒，煙燻過再炙燒也不差，至少\n比舒肥又切的超薄如紙的好多了。\n👍✨️  👍✨️  👍✨️\n⭕️麵條可以續麵兩次等於兩球⭕️\n基本上除非吃快一點，不然低湯\n量要續兩次湯都沒了，湯溫也都\n低了。⭕️加湯一樣是加清高湯⭕️\n麵條是中捲麵呈現，加麵也是。\n麵條口感不差掛湯力普通。如圖\n🔖炸牡蠣與漢堡排好吃🔖\n這兩樣都滿推薦的，那是因為有\n人共食，不然我個人是點不到。\n⭕️唯一要說是筍干得另外單點⭕️\n轉味選項得另外花$50元！！\n\n以區域性來說：：：：：\n⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ 四星評價。\n很值得嘗試的店家。😋😋\n祝生意興隆，感恩感謝。\n🌍2026.03.",null,[0,37]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLUlZOR2JIZGxWelZ1VmxSbmRGWnJZek5pV0VaM1UyeFNVVlF4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLUlZOR2JIZGxWelZ1VmxSbmRGWnJZek5pV0VaM1UyeFNVVlF4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLUlZOR2JIZGxWelZ1VmxSbmRGWnJZek5pV0VaM1UyeFNVVlF4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLUlZOR2JIZGxWelZ1VmxSbmRGWnJZek5pV0VaM1UyeFNVVlF4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLUlZOR2JIZGxWelZ1VmxSbmRGWnJZek5pV0VaM1UyeFNVVlF4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14467850018834258685/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVLUlZOR2JIZGxWelZ1VmxSbmRGWnJZek5pV0VaM1UyeFNVVlF4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1629,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KRVNGbHdlVzVuVlRndFZrYzNiWEZ3U2xSUVQxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1fe18f27b1b59fb4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodC